{"id": "56442", "title": "公主多情(慎)", "author": "長醉", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 6, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/56/56442.htm", "intro": "属性分类：架空／异国背景／一般言情／末定\r\n关键字：瑾希 　眾男 　其它\r\n\r\n简介： \r\n将这一切都当做是个梦，梦醒后的我还是那个我。可是当这一切都毫无悬念的进行著，我才发现，我竟然不舍醒来。\r\n\r\n里面有父女，有美男，很多帅哥的说~还有最重要的肉肉~~", "base": "files/article/html/56/56442", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "7886556.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "7886560.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "7886563.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "7886566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "7886568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "7886570.html", "available": false}]}